{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-post-js","path":"/014-spooky-ghost/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Wood Times"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"710d4f6c-0476-5660-8ad0-8cde26452047","excerpt":"Halloween called for a quick project, and my daughter was a helper eager to try out the bandsaw. With proper safety gear - hearing protection and safety glasses…","html":"<p>Halloween called for a quick project, and my daughter was a helper eager to try out the bandsaw. With proper safety gear - hearing protection and safety glasses - she guided the plywood through the curves of our ghost template.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/32065b917c4c74f9fdaac26ffc003722/669cd/cutting.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 133.54430379746836%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Cutting\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/32065b917c4c74f9fdaac26ffc003722/f058b/cutting.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/32065b917c4c74f9fdaac26ffc003722/c26ae/cutting.png 158w,\n/static/32065b917c4c74f9fdaac26ffc003722/6bdcf/cutting.png 315w,\n/static/32065b917c4c74f9fdaac26ffc003722/f058b/cutting.png 630w,\n/static/32065b917c4c74f9fdaac26ffc003722/40601/cutting.png 945w,\n/static/32065b917c4c74f9fdaac26ffc003722/78612/cutting.png 1260w,\n/static/32065b917c4c74f9fdaac26ffc003722/669cd/cutting.png 3024w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>The bandsaw is a great first power tool for young woodworkers. The blade moves in one direction (down into the table), the workpiece stays flat, and the feed rate is completely controlled by the operator. Perfect for building confidence and learning to read how the wood responds.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/becac49f292dc8eb57d00db7a93b4f94/669cd/finished.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 133.54430379746836%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Finished\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/becac49f292dc8eb57d00db7a93b4f94/f058b/finished.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/becac49f292dc8eb57d00db7a93b4f94/c26ae/finished.png 158w,\n/static/becac49f292dc8eb57d00db7a93b4f94/6bdcf/finished.png 315w,\n/static/becac49f292dc8eb57d00db7a93b4f94/f058b/finished.png 630w,\n/static/becac49f292dc8eb57d00db7a93b4f94/40601/finished.png 945w,\n/static/becac49f292dc8eb57d00db7a93b4f94/78612/finished.png 1260w,\n/static/becac49f292dc8eb57d00db7a93b4f94/669cd/finished.png 3024w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>A few coats of white paint, some drilled eye holes, and a cutout smile transformed the plywood blank into a proper spooky ghost. Not bad for an afternoon project.  It was on our front yaerd light by the evening.</p>\n<p>Sometimes the best projects aren’t about fancy joinery or exotic woods. They’re about making something fun with someone you care about, and maybe sparking a lifelong interest in making things.</p>","frontmatter":{"title":"Spooky Ghost","date":"October 27, 2018","description":null}},"previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/013-spokeshave-kit/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Spokeshave Kit"}},"next":{"fields":{"slug":"/015-wood-cookies/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Wood Cookies"}}},"pageContext":{"id":"710d4f6c-0476-5660-8ad0-8cde26452047","previousPostId":"7a931caa-4614-5099-9c97-c6ff1001db29","nextPostId":"95fdd01a-4733-5df0-a61d-4f769e7aefc1"}},"staticQueryHashes":["2841359383"],"slicesMap":{}}